</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>A rest, where all our soul’s desire</l><l>Is fixed on things above;</l><l>Where fear and sin and grief expire,</l><l>Cast out by perfect love.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Oh, that I now the rest might know,</l><l>Believe, and enter in;</l><l>Now, Savior, now the power bestow,</l><l>And let me cease from sin.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Remove this hardness from my heart,</l><l>This unbelief remove;</l><l>To me the rest of faith impart,</l><l>The Sabbath of Thy love.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>I would be Thine, Thou know’st I would,</l><l>And have Thee all my own;</l><l>Thee, O my all-sufficient Good,</l><l>I want, and Thee alone.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
